9fa73befaaa32a51END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_WhatToDo</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_WhatToDo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_WhatToDo\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">6ee84561-deb1-4be4-bf08-0c90fe0eafb5</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6ee84561-deb1-4be4-bf08-0c90fe0eafb5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6ee84561-deb1-4be4-bf08-0c90fe0eafb5\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the mailbox of <a href=\"/wiki/Bonecloak%27s_Apothecary\" title=\"Bonecloak's Apothecary\">Bonecloak's Apothecary</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-22&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-47</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Esteemed Apothecary Bonecloak,\n</p><p>I've got myself into a fix and need some medicinal advice to get out of it. To deal with my spells, for the last nine months, I've been drinking a daily healing potion following a recipe I got from Baldur's Mouth, except I always double the sherry.\n</p><p><br>\nThe trouble is, it isn't working like it used to, my spells are coming back, and I'm afraid to increase the dosage because I saw what happened to Aunt Balmyre.\n</p><p><br>\nWhat can you prescribe? I'll come by tomorrow for a little consultation.\n</p><p>- Bugs Stillwater\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211829\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.089 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1359/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25093/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6824/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935655/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   72.842      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   72.842      1 -total\n 48.22%   35.127      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.08%   31.381     15 Template:Trim\n 25.73%   18.746      2 Template:Uid\n 15.82%   11.524      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.72%    8.538      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.00%    7.286      1 Template:Uuid\n  9.77%    7.119      2 Template:NorbyteLink\n  8.83%    6.435      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35149-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714211829 and revision id 225449. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}